# Explain Simply

An AI-powered web app that makes complex topics easier to understand through simple, clear explanations.

## Live Demo

Try the app here: "Explain Simply" (https://explain-simply-6qpta1zpe-kdryan.vercel.app/)

## Features

- Get simple explanations of complex topics.
- Explore different topics and questions.
- Choose an explanation level that suits you.
- Use an easy-to-understand interface.

## Tech Stack

- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Google Gemini API
- Node.js
- Express
- Vercel

## Getting Started

1. Clone or fork this repository.
2. Install the project dependencies.
3. Configure the required environment variables.
4. Run the app locally or deploy it using Vercel.

